    "description": "Teacher Kemal (Ediz Hun) had to raise his daughter alone. In this process, he took responsibility for his daughter's education and missed being her playmate. Teacher Deniz (Berna Üçkaleler) complains about her father not being able to take care of her when she was little because of his workload, and plans to take over Kaktüs College and sell it. In order to regain the time he missed with his daughter and to prove to his daughter how valuable special people each of our children are, Teacher Kemal proposes a race to Teacher Deniz, using the inter-school festival as an excuse. Since Teacher Deniz is sure that he will win the competition, he immediately accepts this competition offer. However, the children's team consisting of Popstar, Atom, Arabesk, Messi, Obelix, Ayaklı Gazete, Hack-i Can, Organiz and Einstein will radically change the situation.",
